<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean firms to seek cottonseed, rapeseed meal.</title>
<headline>S.Korean firms to seek cottonseed, rapeseed meal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean feed mill companies will buy 8,000 tonnes of cottonseed meal and 12,500 tonnes of rapeseed meal, traders said on Monday.  </p>
<p>Traders said the South Korean feed millers would invite the tenders by 04:00 p.m. (0700 GMT) on Tuesday.</p>
<p>They said these companies were seeking cottonseed meal for delivery on December 10 and rapeseed meal for delivery on March 20.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822)727 5651</p>
